        <mxCell id="6PVqhWmN0gAd-pwTR8wD-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0); font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Initiation from wallet can be triggerd on two ways:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;a.) There is preconfigured list of Credentials (with link to the National Issuers?)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot; size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;b.) From RP wallet (holder) gets request for a credential it doesn&#39;t hold locally. Wallet should have internally information about credential issuer Identifier, in order to be able to query its metadata&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
